{"3840950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bitter Harvest", "steam_appid": 3840950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bitter Harvest</strong> is a narrative-driven farming sim offering a 5-8 hour single-player campaign shaped by relationships, moral choices, and branching endgame outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/84655aeff8de06b52de73d2623003e09.poster.avif?t=1783123708\" width=540 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/84655aeff8de06b52de73d2623003e09.webm?t=1783123708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/84655aeff8de06b52de73d2623003e09.mp4?t=1783123708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dream of owning a farm falls apart the moment you arrive in the village. The land has already been claimed, and the only job left is collecting the town’s garbage. With nothing but determination, you begin piecing together a new life from what others throw away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bitter Harvest</i> is a 2D farming simulation about ambition, reinvention, and quiet revenge. Earn money through crafting, farming, and odd jobs as you climb from the bottom of the social ladder. Build relationships with the townsfolk, uncover their secrets, and decide how far you’re willing to go to take back what was stolen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you work honestly, use what you learn about others to your advantage, or bend the town’s trust to get ahead? Your actions shape your reputation, your relationships, and the kind of ending you receive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/ed92a8bc214c036239c2ac64a48bf8e5.poster.avif?t=1783123708\" width=554 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/ed92a8bc214c036239c2ac64a48bf8e5.webm?t=1783123708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/ed92a8bc214c036239c2ac64a48bf8e5.mp4?t=1783123708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rags-to-riches story</strong>: Rise from trash collector to landowner through work, wit, or manipulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming</strong>: Grow and sell crops to earn income and expand your land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting</strong>: Turn salvaged materials into tools, goods, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing</strong>: Spend quiet days by the water or reel in catches to sell at the market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining</strong>: Dig for ore and rare finds to fuel your rise in the village economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking:</strong> Create meals that boost your energy, charm, or profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games: </strong>Play optional cooking and crafting mini-games or turn them off if you wish </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personal relationships</strong>: Each villager reacts to your choices, ambitions, and reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scandals and secrets</strong>: Learn what others hide and decide whether to use it for profit or let it be.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy world with sharp undertones</strong>: Peaceful days and simple labor hide a story about power and consequence.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bitter Harvest</strong> is a narrative-driven farming sim offering a 5-8 hour single-player campaign shaped by relationships, moral choices, and branching endgame outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/84655aeff8de06b52de73d2623003e09.poster.avif?t=1783123708\" width=540 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/84655aeff8de06b52de73d2623003e09.webm?t=1783123708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840950/extras/84655aeff8de06b52de73d2623003e09.mp4?t=1783123708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dream of owning a farm falls apart the moment you arrive in the village. The land has already been claimed, and the only job left is collecting the town’s garbage. With nothing but determination, you begin piecing together a new life from what others throw away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bitter Harvest</i> is a 2D farming simulation about ambition, reinvention, and quiet revenge. Earn money through crafting, farming, and odd jobs as you climb from the bottom of the social ladder. Build relationships with the townsfolk, uncover their secrets, and decide how far you’re willing to go to take back what was stolen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you work honestly, use what you learn about others to your advantage, or bend the town’s trust to get ahead? Your actions shape your reputation, your relationships, and the kind of ending you receive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"